# Copy to .env.local. A real Postgres connection string — for local dev,
# point this at a local Postgres instance (see packages/db/.env.example
# for how to create one); for a shared dev/prod database, use the
# connection string from your Supabase project's dashboard (Project
# Settings > Database > Connection string). Same value as packages/db/.env
# — unlike the old SQLite file paths, a network connection string
# doesn't depend on either package's working directory.
#
# Direct connection (port 5432, shown below) vs. Supabase's pooler
# (Supavisor, port 6543) depends on where this deploys — see
# docs/adr/0005-postgres-migration-via-supabase.md's Consequences
# section. Direct is right for local dev and any long-running server;
# switch to the pooler ("Transaction" mode) only for a serverless
# deploy target (Vercel and similar).
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://movewise:movewise_dev@localhost:5432/movewise_dev"
